# Which skill covers which files, for the hooks' skill doorbell (devscripts/hooks/load-the-skill.sh).
# One "<glob> <skill>" per line; the first match wins, so the more specific patterns come first.
*.razor blazor-ui
*.razor.cs blazor-ui
*.razor.css blazor-ui
*Database.Entities/* data-layer
*Database.Sql.Configurations/* data-layer
*Core.Services.Repositories/* data-layer
*Database.EfCore/* data-layer
*.Log.cs logging
*.razor.Log.cs logging
*/Logging/* logging
# "~<regex> <skill>": rings on what is written, in any file. Every matching line adds its skill.
~LoggerMessage|ILogger<|\.Log(Error|Warning|Information|Debug|Critical|Trace)\( logging
